From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openEuler RISC-V Package Automation <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] transport_hep: include inet_pton declaration

transport_hep.c calls inet_pton for IPv4 and IPv6 HEP chunks but does not
include arpa/inet.h, which declares that interface. Modern compilers reject
the resulting implicit function declaration. Include the standard header
without changing HEP behavior.

Patch-Source: openEuler RISC-V package CI failure analysis
Patch-License: GPL-3.0-or-later
Upstream-Status: Not Submitted (automated upstream writes are not authorized)
Remove-When: Upstream transport_hep.c includes arpa/inet.h in a packaged release.
---
 src/transport_hep.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/transport_hep.c b/src/transport_hep.c
--- a/src/transport_hep.c
+++ b/src/transport_hep.c
@@ -23,1 +23,2 @@
+#include <arpa/inet.h>
 #include <sys/socket.h>
